{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117917","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117917/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117917/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117917/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117917","id":4156188815,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc73umiP","number":117917,"title":"FoldableContainer unclear child visibilty rules.","user":{"login":"DataPlusProgram","id":62811101,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyODExMTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62811101?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DataPlusProgram","html_url":"https://github.com/DataPlusProgram","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DataPlusProgram/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DataPlusProgram/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DataPlusProgram/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DataPlusProgram/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DataPlusProgram/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DataPlusProgram/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DataPlusProgram/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DataPlusProgram/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DataPlusProgram/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-27T22:09:29Z","updated_at":"2026-03-28T11:47:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.7 dev 2\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt is not posible to hide a direct child of a `FoldableContainer` \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b9fb36d8-3154-48c5-94db-8ad5f4eab576\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIf you click the visibilty button of any child of a `FoldableContainer` it will not do anything.\n\nThe current documentation states:\n\n> Child control nodes are hidden when the container is collapsed. Ignores non-control children.\n\nWhat it currenlty does is set all childrens visiblility to the parent's value every visibilty update.\nThe result of this is that pressing the visbility button doesn't do anything because the visibilty update just resets it to the parent values immediately.\n\nIf this was to work as the documentation decribes it would only overwrite the childrens visiblity on collapse not on every visiblity update. As such setting a child to be invisbile in the editor would be possible under those rules.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMRP is not necessary","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117917/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117917/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}